---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "English, learned by doing"
description: "Palm River Academy is an English language center in Hội An for children from 20 months to 18. We teach English through science, maths, cooking, art and sport, in classes of 13 or fewer."
---
{% import "macros/icons.njk" as ic %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__bg" style="--focus: 28% 30%">{% photo "hero-cooking-class-hoi-an", "", "100vw", true %}</div>
  <img class="leaf leaf--tr" src="{{ '/assets/img/leaf-a.webp' | url }}" alt="" width="900" height="910">
  <img class="leaf leaf--bl" src="{{ '/assets/img/leaf-b.webp' | url }}" alt="" width="900" height="910">
  <div class="wrap hero__inner">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--on rise" style="--d:0">English Language Center · Hội An</p>
    <h1 class="rise" style="--d:1">English, learned <span class="mark">by doing.</span></h1>
    <p class="lede rise" style="--d:2">We are an English language center for children from 20 months to 18 years. Our students learn English through science, maths, cooking, art and sport. Content through context. Less studying English, more doing things in English.</p>
    <div class="hero__actions rise" style="--d:3">
      <a class="btn btn--sun" href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">Book a tour</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost-white" href="{{ '/learning/' | url }}">Our programs</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ul class="hero__facts" aria-label="At a glance">
    <li class="sticker sticker--sun">20 months to 18 years</li>
    <li class="sticker sticker--coral">{{ site.classCap }} or fewer per class</li>
    <li class="sticker sticker--green">Since {{ site.founded }}</li>
  </ul>
  {% include "partials/river.njk" %}
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap two">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">Discover our story</p>
      <h2>Serving families in Hội An and Đà Nẵng since {{ site.founded }}</h2>
      <p class="lede lede--blue">Hội An's oldest international learning center.</p>
      <p>We opened in {{ site.founded }} with a handful of families who wanted their children to learn English without sitting still all day. That is still the idea. We combine the Cambridge curriculum with small classes and real-world skills: public speaking, art, technology, cooking, sport. About half our families are Vietnamese and half are from abroad, and the same goes for our teachers.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">About us</a>
    </div>
    <div class="blob-wrap has-sticker">
      <span class="sticker sticker--tl">Est. {{ site.founded }}</span>
      {% photo "community-at-campus-wall", "photo--lg photo--tilt-r" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="ribbons" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg class="mascot" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M50 95 C 20 70, 10 35, 50 5 C 90 35, 80 70, 50 95 Z" fill="var(--green-light)"/><path d="M50 12 L50 90" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" opacity=".6"/><g class="mascot__eyes"><circle class="eye" cx="42" cy="40" r="7"/><circle class="eye" cx="58" cy="40" r="7"/><circle class="pupil" cx="43" cy="41" r="3"/><circle class="pupil" cx="59" cy="41" r="3"/></g></svg>
  <div class="ribbon ribbon--sun">
    <div class="ribbon__track ribbon__track--rev">
      {% for i in [1, 2] %}<span>Science</span><span>Maths</span><span>Cooking</span><span>Art</span><span>Sport</span><span>Technology</span><span>Public speaking</span><span>Maker Space</span>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="ribbon ribbon--blue">
    <div class="ribbon__track">
      {% for i in [1, 2] %}<span>Intellectual Exploration</span><span>Creative Expression</span><span>Sports and Fun</span><span>Community Impact</span><span>Global Citizenship</span><span>Leadership</span>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="band--pale">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">How we teach English</p>
      <h2>Content through context</h2>
      <p class="lede">Nobody learns a language from a worksheet. Our students learn English because they need it to measure the flour, explain the experiment and argue about the rules of the game.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="method">
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("flask", "blue") }}<strong>Real subjects, in English</strong><p>Cambridge English, Maths and Science every morning, taught in English by qualified teachers. The language comes with the content.</p></div>
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("whisk", "sun") }}<strong>Doing, not drilling</strong><p>Cooking, technology, crafts, art, movement, Maker Space, Art of Science, Everyday Experts. Every afternoon is hands-on.</p></div>
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("chat", "green") }}<strong>Small enough to talk</strong><p>Never more than {{ site.classCap }} in an academic class, so every child speaks, gets heard and gets corrected kindly.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--coral">Academics</p>
      <h2>From 20 months to 18 years</h2>
      <p class="lede">Pick your child's stage. Every one of them keeps the same shape: academic subjects in English, something physical, something made with your hands.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tiles mt">
      {% for p in programs %}{% if p.key != 'global' %}
      <a class="tile tile--{{ p.tone }}" href="{{ p.url | url }}">
        {% photo p.photo, "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 46vw" %}
        <span class="tile__go" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
        <span class="tile__label"><strong>{{ p.name }}</strong><small>{{ p.ages }}</small></span>
      </a>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "blue" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--blue band--bubbles">
  <div class="wrap stats">
    <div class="stat"><p class="stat__num" data-count="{{ site.classCap }}">{{ site.classCap }}</p><h3>Max class size</h3><p>Every academic class is capped at {{ site.classCap }} students, so every child gets care and attention.</p></div>
    <div class="stat"><p class="stat__num" data-count="22">22+</p><h3>Qualified staff</h3><p>International and Vietnamese teachers with experience at every level, from Nursery to Upper Secondary.</p></div>
    <div class="stat"><p class="stat__num" data-count="10">10+</p><h3>Alumni abroad</h3><p>PRA students have gone on to high schools and universities overseas.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap two two--flip">
    <div class="blob-wrap blob-wrap--violet has-sticker">
      <span class="sticker sticker--violet sticker--br">3 weeks to 3 months</span>
      {% photo "global-program-nature-walk", "photo--lg photo--tilt" %}
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--violet">Visiting Hội An?</p>
      <h2>The Global Program</h2>
      <p>Whether you are a travelling family, living in Hội An for a season, or looking for a short-term program to keep your child learning, the Global Program gives you real classes with our regular students for three weeks to three months. Half days or full days, ages 2 to 14, with a progress report and a certificate at the end.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--green" href="{{ '/learning/global-program/' | url }}">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "sun" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--sun">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--sun">Campus life</p>
      <h2>Live, learn and grow at Palm River Academy</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="gallery mt">
      {% photo "gallery-lantern-workshop", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
      {% photo "gallery-magnetic-tiles", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
      {% photo "gallery-cupcake-decorating", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
      {% photo "gallery-chess-library", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
      {% photo "gallery-twister-game", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
      {% photo "gallery-mural-printing", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
      {% photo "gallery-water-play", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
      {% photo "gallery-reading-corner", "", "(min-width: 1240px) 280px, (min-width: 720px) 23vw, 70vw" %}
    </div>
    <p class="gallery__hint" hidden>Tap a photo to see it bigger.</p>
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap two">
    <div class="blob-wrap blob-wrap--green has-sticker">
      <span class="sticker sticker--green sticker--tr">5 min from the old town</span>
      {% photo site.campus.photo, "photo--lg photo--wide" %}
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Find your way to PRA</p>
      <h2>One campus in Cẩm Thanh</h2>
      <p>A few minutes from Hội An's old town. Early Years, Primary, Lower Secondary and Upper Secondary all learn on the same site.</p>
      <p><strong>{{ site.campus.address }}</strong><br>{{ site.hours }}</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.campus.mapUrl }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Open in Google Maps</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "blue" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
